  "known_local_policies": [
    "Hidden Meaning tests the original opponent turn_ended Secret check state, before mana refresh and next-turn start. Actual available mana, including temporary mana, is queried; acceptance survives later reveal reactions. Exact interaction with earlier end triggers remains local pending CN.",
    "Sacred Trial requires a completed actual hand minion play and at least three original actor-controlled active living non-doomed minions captured immediately before its successful board entry, before entry reactions and Battlecry. Battlecry tokens do not backfill eligibility; originally counted minions may subsequently depart. Dormant and exact start-of-play/payment/counter priority remain explicit local policies.",
    "The original uninterrupted board residence remains the victim through transformations and control changes, but genuine departure never rebinds a later residence. Ordinary destruction, Deathrattle, Reborn, quantity, capacity and continuation pipelines are reused.",
    "2019 first-person reports and player timing explanations inform the pre-Battlecry threshold; they are historical community evidence on Blizzard forums, not current CN certification. Full fixed-bound generated pools remain intact; missing implementations or binding fail explicitly without replacement draws."
